User Request:  
"During a maintenance window where we’re rolling out IPv6-labeled unicast services, I need to ensure minimal disruption if a BGP peer fails—what’s the recommended approach to configure fast reroute for these routes on our Nokia 7750 SR routers to maintain seamless traffic convergence?"

