To maintain consistent BGP path selection with deterministic MED evaluation on Nokia 7750 SR routers during your multi-vendor migration, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp best-path-selection deterministic-med
```

**Explanation:**  
This command ensures MED-based path selection is deterministic by grouping routes from the same neighbor AS before comparison. It eliminates inconsistencies caused by the order of route arrival and enforces predictable best-path decisions across diverse peer ASes during migration. The default behavior (`no deterministic-med`) allows non-deterministic MED comparisons, which is resolved by enabling this command.

**Configuration Context:**  
Apply this in the global BGP instance (`config>router>bgp>best-path-selection`). If using VPRN, configure it under `config>service>vprn>bgp>best-path-selection` instead.
