## User question:
During a multi-vendor network migration where we're integrating new Nokia 7750 SR routers into our existing BGP infrastructure, we need to maintain consistent path selection behavior when receiving routes from diverse peer autonomous systems—particularly ensuring MED comparisons remain meaningful regardless of originating AS. What's the proper way to implement this deterministic MED evaluation on Nokia 7750 SR platforms to prevent inconsistent best-path decisions during the transition period?
