2. **`no disable-fast-external-failover`**: Ensures BGP fast external failover is **enabled** (default behavior). This allows immediate session termination upon interface/next-hop failure, aligning with BFD detection.  
3. **`hold-time 3 min 3`**: Sets BGP hold-time to 3 seconds (minimum RFC-compliant value) and enforces a minimum of 3 seconds. This accelerates session re-establishment after failover while maintaining compatibility.  

