        receive-interval 100
        multiplier 3
    exit
exit
```  
**Key Parameters:**  
- `transmit-interval`/`receive-interval`: 100 ms (adjust based on link capabilities).  
- `multiplier 3`: Declares failure after 3 missed packets (300 ms detection).  

> **Note**: Apply the BFD interface configuration to all interfaces used by BGP peers. This achieves end-to-end subsecond convergence when paired with the BGP settings above.
