```cli
configure router
bgp
```

2. To configure attributes at the group level (affects all peers in the group):
```cli
group "GROUP_NAME"
preference 150
exit
```

3. To configure attributes for a specific neighbor within the group:
```cli
group "GROUP_NAME"
neighbor "NEIGHBOR_IP"
peer-as 65002
preference 100
local-as 65530 private no-prepend-global-as
exit
exit
```

### Key Commands Used:
