- `multipath 8` enables ECMP with up to 8 paths per prefix for load distribution.  
- `label-ipv4 send 8` advertises a maximum of 8 labeled IPv4 paths per prefix to peers.  
- `receive none` blocks acceptance of multiple paths from peers to maintain deterministic traffic engineering.  

