resolution-filter
```

### For BGP Prefixes (Shortcut Tunnels):
1. Enter the BGP next-hop resolution context for standard prefixes:
```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution shortcut-tunn family ipv4
```
2. Set the resolution mode (replace `<mode>` with `any`, `filter`, or `disabled`):
```cli
resolution <mode>
```

