   ```
2. Ensure all BGP peers support LLGR (RFC 7911) for compatibility.
3. Verify with `show router bgp neighbor <ip>` post-configuration to confirm LLGR capabilities are active.

This maintains forwarding continuity by extending route preservation beyond standard timers during control plane upgrades.
